 heeft veroverd brengt verantwoordelijkheden waarvoor haar gevaarlijke gave geen eenvoudige oplossing biedt. Als leider van Sector 45 staat zij onder toezicht van andere machthebbers, terwijl nieuwe informatie haar kijk op het verleden aantast. Het vierde boek over Juliette verplaatst de aandacht van ontsnappen naar leidinggeven: zij moet bepalen wie zij wil zijn wanneer persoonlijke verlangens en politieke verwachtingen botsen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1068152/heel-me.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024597017","key":{"isbn_13":"9789024597017"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100002,"title":"Viersprong van de Schemer","isbn_13":"9789024597017","isbn_10":"9024597013","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij","id":975200072}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024597017","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024597017"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463836/het-rad-des-tijds-10-viersprong-van-de-schemer-pod.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463836/het-rad-des-tijds-10-viersprong-van-de-schemer-pod.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000402221_Viersprong_van_de_schemer_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:47:05.411Z","sha256":"f69bf99989090f7f4b222d560da49ac25141f4f9ee10e76a58a00ab69bd10ae0","bytes":318346,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789024597017","work_id":975100002,"bound_author_id":8800015,"bound_title":"Viersprong van de Schemer","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789024597017","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000402221_Viersprong_van_de_schemer_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463836/het-rad-des-tijds-10-viersprong-van-de-schemer-pod.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:1620:nl","key":{"work_id":975100002,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463836/het-rad-des-tijds-10-viersprong-van-de-schemer-pod.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463836/het-rad-des-tijds-10-viersprong-van-de-schemer-pod.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000402221_Viersprong_van_de_schemer_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:47:05.411Z","sha256":"f69bf99989090f7f4b222d560da49ac25141f4f9ee10e76a58a00ab69bd10ae0","bytes":318346,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100002,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":8800015,"text":"De strijd tegen de Schaduw verdeelt de hoofdpersonen over verschillende fronten. Mart zoekt bescherming voor zichzelf en zijn reisgezelschap, Perijn wil Faile terugvinden en Elayne probeert haar aanspraak op de troon van Andor waar te maken. Egwene en Rhand staan voor eigen politieke problemen. In dit tiende deel van Het Rad des Tijds worden hun keuzes steeds nauwer verbonden met het gevaar dat de wereld bedreigt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463836/het-rad-des-tijds-10-viersprong-van-de-schemer-pod.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024555482","key":{"isbn_13":"9789024555482"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100003,"title":"Het pad der dolken","isbn_13":"9789024555482","isbn_10":"9024555485","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij","id":975200073}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024555482","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024555482"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/532672/het-pad-der-dolken.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/532672/het-pad-der-dolken.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000214404_Het_pad_der_dolken_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:47:07.244Z","sha256":"559a1ad881dda39e01542219d2d199f1aa39bd5c851733bdc6c4a3384b2f2e7b","bytes":97212,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789024555482","work_id":975100003,"bound_author_id":8800015,"bound_title":"Het pad der dolken","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789024555482","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000214404_Het_pad_der_dolken_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/532672/het-pad-der-dolken.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:1624:nl","key":{"work_id":975100003,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/532672/het-pad-der-dolken.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/532672/het-pad-der-dolken.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000214404_Het_pad_der_dolken_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:47:07.244Z","sha256":"559a1ad881dda39e01542219d2d199f1aa39bd5c851733bdc6c4a3384b2f2e7b","bytes":97212,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100003,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":8800015,"text":"Rhand wil de Seanchanen terugdringen, maar de toestand onder zijn eigen volgelingen bemoeilijkt zijn plannen. Ondertussen reizen Nynaeve, Elayne en Aviendha vanuit het ingenomen Ebo Dar naar Caemlin. Ook Perijn en de opstandige Aes Sedai staan onder druk. Het achtste deel van Het Rad des Tijds laat zien hoe het zoeken naar politieke en militaire uitwegen nieuwe persoonlijke risico''s met zich meebrengt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/532672/het-pad-der-dolken.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024566129","key":{"isbn_13":"9789024566129"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100004,"title":"De Komst van de Schaduw","isbn_13":"9789024566129","isbn_10":"9024566126","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij","id":975200074}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024566129","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024566129"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463827/het-rad-des-tijds-4-de-komst-van-de-schaduw-pod.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463827/het-rad-des-tijds-4-de-komst-van-de-schaduw-pod.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/00001