el van Het Rad des Tijds volgt zijn poging zelf richting te geven aan een onzekere toekomst.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463827/het-rad-des-tijds-4-de-komst-van-de-schaduw-pod.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024554133","key":{"isbn_13":"9789024554133"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100005,"title":"Heer van Chaos","isbn_13":"9789024554133","isbn_10":"9024554136","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij","id":975200075}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024554133","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024554133"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463833/het-rad-des-tijds-6-heer-van-chaos-pod.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463833/het-rad-des-tijds-6-heer-van-chaos-pod.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000213387_Heer_van_chaos_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:47:10.824Z","sha256":"fb22cd856dcfa4e0aefed176d6306edb309f68bcd0a54dbaec5453ef5c3041cd","bytes":113457,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"},{"reviewNote":"Bureau location/Rhuidean prose appears to repeat earlier-volume events; only independently safe book6 political conflict retained"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789024554133","work_id":975100005,"bound_author_id":8800015,"bound_title":"Heer van Chaos","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789024554133","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000213387_Heer_van_chaos_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463833/het-rad-des-tijds-6-heer-van-chaos-pod.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:1892:nl","key":{"work_id":975100005,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463833/het-rad-des-tijds-6-heer-van-chaos-pod.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463833/het-rad-des-tijds-6-heer-van-chaos-pod.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000213387_Heer_van_chaos_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:47:10.824Z","sha256":"fb22cd856dcfa4e0aefed176d6306edb309f68bcd0a54dbaec5453ef5c3041cd","bytes":113457,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"},{"reviewNote":"Bureau location/Rhuidean prose appears to repeat earlier-volume events; only independently safe book6 political conflict retained"}],"work_id":975100005,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":8800015,"text":"Rhand Altor wordt geconfronteerd met gebieden en bondgenoten die zich niet eenvoudig laten leiden. Terwijl de dreiging van de Duistere groeit, zoeken verschillende machten naar voordeel in de onrust. Zijn bijzondere positie biedt geen vanzelfsprekend gezag of veiligheid. In het zesde deel van Het Rad des Tijds draait de strijd daarom niet alleen om een vijand verslaan, maar ook om steun behouden binnen een verdeelde wereld.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463833/het-rad-des-tijds-6-heer-van-chaos-pod.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024554034","key":{"isbn_13":"9789024554034"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100006,"title":"Vuur uit de Hemel","isbn_13":"9789024554034","isbn_