prekende paard Brie maakt een vlucht mogelijk. Hun tocht vanuit Calormen richting Narnia brengt nieuwe reisgenoten en gevaren. De jongen moet onderweg leren beoordelen wie hij kan vertrouwen, terwijl de bestemming minder veilig blijkt dan hij had gehoopt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/535233/het-paard-en-de-jongen.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789026610622","key":{"isbn_13":"9789026610622"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100010,"title":"Het laatste gevecht","isbn_13":"9789026610622","isbn_10":"9026610629","language":"nld","publisher":"VBK Media","id":975200080}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789026610622","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789026610622"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/535248/het-laatste-gevecht.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/535248/het-laatste-gevecht.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000127234_Het_laatste_gevecht_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:47:19.857Z","sha256":"0f9513260abd6ad23716b5d474a4b7555e2d84c93b57d93797f0a66642b7a3a0","bytes":95112,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789026610622","work_id":975100010,"bound_author_id":921300021,"bound_title":"Het laatste gevecht","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789026610622","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000127234_Het_laatste_gevecht_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/535248/het-laatste-gevecht.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2173:nl","key":{"work_id":975100010,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/535248/het-laatste-gevecht.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/535248/het-laatste-gevecht.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000127234_Het_laatste_gevecht_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:47:19.857Z","sha256":"0f9513260abd6ad23716b5d474a4b7555e2d84c93b57d93797f0a66642b7a3a0","bytes":95112,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100010,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":921300021,"text":"Een valse Aslan brengt de bewoners van Narnia in verwarring. De aap Draaier gebruikt een vermomde ezel om bevelen te laten opvolgen, met steeds ernstiger gevolgen voor het land. Koning Tirian krijgt hulp van Jill en Eustaas, maar de dreiging raakt meer dan alleen zijn gezag. Het laatste Narnia-boek draait om vertrouwen, bedrog en de keuzes van mensen en dieren wanneer hun vertrouwde wereld verandert.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/535248/het-laatste-gevecht.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789026610608","key":{"isbn_13":"9789026610608"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100011,"title":"De reis van het drakenschip","isbn_13":"9789026610608","isbn_10":"9026610602","language":"nld","publisher":"VBK Media","id":975200081}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789026610608","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789026610608"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","revie