6500d16b7038821e0c7377b2eb6b","bytes":96495,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"},{"reviewNote":"Source includes ChrisStaplesLewis alias; canonicalC.S.Lewis and existingWork retained, no duplicateauthor imported"}],"work_id":975100011,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":921300021,"text":"Een schilderij voert Lucy, Edmund en hun neef Eustaas onverwacht naar een schip op zee. Daar ontmoeten zij Caspian opnieuw en raken betrokken bij zijn zoektocht naar zeven verdwenen vrienden van zijn vader. De reis langs onbekende eilanden stelt de kinderen telkens voor nieuwe uitdagingen. Dit Narnia-avontuur volgt niet alleen de bestemming van het schip, maar ook de vraag hoe de reizigers met elkaar en het onbekende omgaan.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/380188/de-reis-van-het-drakenschip.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789026610615","key":{"isbn_13":"9789026610615"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100012,"title":"De zilveren stoel","isbn_13":"9789026610615","isbn_10":"9026610610","language":"nld","publisher":"VBK Media","id":975200082}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789026610615","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789026610615"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/535243/de-zilveren-stoel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/535243/de-zilveren-stoel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000127233_De_zilveren_stoel_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:06.896Z","sha256":"b36beca960efbc56087e1c01624cec39e1ea145f8bf1c7ed42c17a8b52e1fbbb","byte