","bound_author_id":8800015,"text":"Terwijl Rhand en Min hun achtervolgers proberen te misleiden, wordt Elaynes positie in Caemlin bemoeilijkt door rivalen en problemen aan de grens. Mart zoekt ondertussen een uitweg uit het bezette Ebo Dar. In het negende deel van Het Rad des Tijds moeten de hoofdpersonen handelen zonder volledig te weten wat hun bondgenoten van plan zijn. Persoonlijke veiligheid en politieke verantwoordelijkheid blijken moeilijk van elkaar te scheiden.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463826/het-rad-des-tijds-9-hart-van-de-winter-pod.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789089680716","key":{"isbn_13":"9789089680716"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100015,"title":"Het vuur van de herfst","isbn_13":"9789089680716","isbn_10":"9089680713","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V.","id":975200085}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789089680716","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789089680716"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/97177/het-vuur-van-de-herfst.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/97177/het-vuur-van-de-herfst.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000123425_Het_vuur_van_de_herfst_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:12.486Z","sha256":"765fdf30c810e9434bb52087729f7b4653eeec7a4b283cb3a3313934eadc25a0","bytes":63776,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"},{"reviewNote":"Publisher/Bureau blurb says American CivilWar around1767; historically inconsistent. Summary uses colonial settlement/family journey, no CivilWar or disputed state"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789089680716","work_id":975100015,"bound_author_id":8800014,"bound_title":"Het vuur van de herfst","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789089680716","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000123425_Het_vuur_van_de_herfst_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/97177/het-vuur-van-de-herfst.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2196:nl","key":{"work_id":975100015,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/97177/het-vuur-van-de-herfst.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/97177/het-vuur-van-de-herfst.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000123425_Het_vuur_van_de_herfst_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:12.486Z","sha256":"765fdf30c810e9434bb52087729f7b4653eeec7a4b283cb3a3313934eadc25a0","bytes":63776,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"},{"reviewNote":"Publisher/Bureau blurb says American CivilWar around1767; historically inconsistent. Summary uses colonial settlement/family journey, no CivilWar or disputed state"}],"work_id":975100015,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":8800014,"text":"Jamie en Claire proberen in de Amerikaanse koloniën een bestaan op te bouwen tussen andere Schotse emigranten. In een andere tijd ontdekt Brianna iets waardoor zij besluit haar ouders achterna te reizen. Het vierde Reiziger-boek verbindt de poging ergens thuis te raken met de gevolgen van die oversteek. Familiebanden bieden houvast, maar een ontmoeting tussen mensen uit verschillende tijden brengt ook nieuwe onzekerheden.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/97177/het-vuur-van-de-herfst.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789089680723","key":{"isbn_13":"9789089680723"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100016,"title":"De verre kust","isbn_13":"9789089680723","isbn_10":"9089680721","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V.","id":975200086}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789089680723","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789089680723"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/412971/de-verre-kust.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/412971/de-verre-kust.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000123426_De_verre_kust_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:14.284Z","sha256":"e37d822ccff31f6539356ba833ce6c64e2af2036bad0a0f8024c80618aaab8b8","bytes":44845,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789089680723","work_id":975100016,"bound_author_id":8800014,"bound_title":"De verre kust","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789089680723","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000123426_De_verre_kust_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/412971/de-verre-kust.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2197:nl","key":{"work_id":975100016,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/412971/de-verre-kust.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/412971/de-verre-kust.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000123426_De_verre_kust_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:14.284Z","sha256":"e37d822ccff31f6539356ba833ce6c64e2af2036bad0a0f8024c80618aaab8b8","bytes":44845,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100016,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":8800014,"text":"Claire heeft haar dochter zien opgroeien, maar haar verbondenheid met Jamie is niet verdwenen. Ze besluit terug te keren naar het achttiende-eeuwse Schotland en moet opnieuw haar plaats vinden in zijn leven. Hun hereniging levert niet de rust op waarop zij had kunnen hopen: een gedwongen zeereis verandert de omstandigheden. Het derde Reiziger-boek volgt hoe hun liefde zich verhoudt tot tijd, afstand en onverwachte wendingen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/412971/de-verre-kust.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789089681737","key":{"isbn_13":"9789089681737"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100017,"title":"Sneeuw en as","isbn_13":"9789089681737","isbn_10":"9089681736","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V.","id":975200087}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789089681737","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789089681737"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/363863/sneeuw-en-as.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/363863/sneeuw-en-as.html","checkedAt