randering afstevent, zonder dat voorkennis hun een eenvoudige of veilige uitweg biedt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/363863/sneeuw-en-as.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789089680785","key":{"isbn_13":"9789089680785"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100018,"title":"Een echo in de tijd","isbn_13":"9789089680785","isbn_10":"9089680780","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V.","id":975200088}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789089680785","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789089680785"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/18937/een-echo-in-de-tijd.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/18937/een-echo-in-de-tijd.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000002823_Een_echo_in_de_tijd_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:17.848Z","sha256":"da0acbfb695dd8954195cab62bc37ca045a6befa75f10e254adaa8b01ef6fc4f","bytes":73648,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789089680785","work_id":975100018,"bound_author_id":8800014,"bound_title":"Een echo in de tijd","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789089680785","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000002823_Een_echo_in_de_tijd_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/18937/een-echo-in-de-tijd.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2200:nl","key":{"work_id":975100018,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/18937/een-echo-in-de-tijd.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/18937/een-echo-in-de-tijd.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000002823_Een_echo_in_de_tijd_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:17.848Z","sha256":"da0acbfb695dd8954195cab62bc37ca045a6befa75f10e254adaa8b01ef6fc4f","bytes":73648,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100018,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":8800014,"text":"Jamie en Claire beleven de Amerikaanse opstand met kennis die niet alle mensen om hen heen bezitten. Weten welke partij uiteindelijk wint, garandeert echter niet dat hun dierbaren de strijd overleven. Voor Jamie maakt vooral de mogelijkheid zijn zoon tegenover zich te vinden het gevaar persoonlijk. Het zevende Reiziger-boek verbindt het verloop van de geschiedenis met hun pogingen elkaar en hun familie te beschermen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/18937/een-echo-in-de-tijd.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789047511557","key":{"isbn_13":"9789047511557"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100019,"title":"Brug naar de hemel","isbn_13":"9789047511557","isbn_10":"9047511557","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V.","id":975200089}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789047511557","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789047511557"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/372537/brug-naar-de-hemel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/372537/brug-naar-de-hemel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://www.bibliotheek.nl/catalogus/titel.410913049.html/brug-naar-de-hemel/","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Independent identity/content corroboration"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000104079_Brug_naar_de_hemel_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:19.647Z","sha256":"c468265e0855c69cd0631bd55ad6a5a6c84f2fef71581ccf12f1558ebfbea24a","bytes":87283,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789047511557","work_id":975100019,"bound_author_id":928300358,"bound_title":"Brug naar de hemel","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789047511557","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000104079_Brug_naar_de_hemel_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/372537/brug-naar-de-hemel.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2201:nl","key":{"work_id":975100019,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/372537/brug-naar-de-hemel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/372537/brug-naar-de-hemel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://www.bibliotheek.nl/catalogus/titel.410913049.html/brug-naar-de-hemel/","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Independent identity/content corroboration"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000104079_Brug_naar_de_hemel_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:19.647Z","sha256":"c468265e0855c69cd0631bd55ad6a5a6c84f2fef71581ccf12f1558ebfbea24a","bytes":87283,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100019,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":928300358,"text":"Vier kinderen uit Kingsbridge zijn in 1327 getuige van een gewelddadige gebeurtenis in het bos. Hun levens blijven daardoor met elkaar verbonden, al verschillen hun verlangens en kansen. De roman keert terug naar de stad van Pilaren van de aarde en haar kathedraal. Via de verschillende personages verkent Follett hoe persoonlijke ambities botsen met politieke, maatschappelijke en godsdienstige verhoudingen in het veertiende-eeuwse Engeland.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/372537/brug-naar-de-hemel.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}}],"bindings":[{"work":{"id":928101387,"title":"The Pillars of the Earth","cover_id":null,"author_id":928300358,"work_type":null,"source_type":"open_library","open_library_id":"OL1914022W","first_publish_year":1989,"native_identity_key":null},"author":{"id":928300358,"name":"Ken Follett","open_library_id":"OL229268A"}},{"work":{"id":975100001,"title":"Restore me","cover_id":null,"author_id":924300154,"work_type":null,"source_type":"open_library","open_library_id":"OL19737574W","first_publish_year":2018,"native_identity_key":null},"author":{"id":924300154,"name":"Tahereh Mafi","open_library_id":"OL6964763A"}},{"work":{"id":975100002,"title":"Crossroads of Twilight","cover_id":null,"author_id":8800015,"work_type":null,"source_type":"open_library","open_library_id":"OL7924099W","first_publish_year":1995,"native_identity_key":null},"author":{"id":8800015,"name":"Robert Jordan","open_library_id":"OL233594A"}},{"work":{"id":975100003,"title":"The Path of Daggers","cover_id":null,"author_id":8800015,"work_type":null,"source_type":"open_library","open_library_id":"OL1946687W","first_publish_year":1998,"native_identity_key":null},"author":{"id":8800015,"name":"Robert Jordan","open_library_id":"OL